Viktor 10.10.2026: «Артиста по модели InvokeAI постарайся на максимум вывести со всем возможным ахуем».

«Mask…» beside the reference opens the picture over the page with a red layer painted by the pointer: Paint and Erase (B, E), the brush's size (its ring follows the pointer; [ and ], kept), Invert, Clear, «No mask», Done (Enter; Esc leaves it as it was). Done keeps the mask as a PNG at the reference's own size, white where it repaints; the button says «Mask ✓» and the thumbnail carries the red; a new reference drops the mask. Draw sends it with the picture; «Again» on a masked run sends the run's own picture and mask; the stage says «from a reference · 1.00 · masked». Lab 1306 does the repainting (the kept part put back at every step, the reference's own pixels outside the mask).

Suite: 558/0 in the kitchen; pictures of the editor and the thumbnail by tools/claude-mask-probe.mjs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
